<title>UK: Electra Investment to take 25 pct of Derby FC - FT.</title>
<headline>Electra Investment to take 25 pct of Derby FC - FT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Electra Investment Trust plans to pay 10 million stg for a 25 percent stake in English premier league soccer club Derby County, the Financial Times reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The deal between Electra and Derby owner Lionel Pickering will be announced in the next few days, the report said.</p>
<p>The proceeds are expected to be spent on new players and paying back some of the money borrowed to fund a new 20 million stg stadium.</p>
<p>The sale of the stake is expected to be the first step on the road to a stock market flotation.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
